            "review_title": "Review at Xiu Nho Baguette",
            "review_text": "ucfknight197\nSingapore, Singapore21 contributions\n0\nSimply the best place for banh mi in Saigon\nAug 2016 • Friends\nXiu Nho is an unassuming little place in the heart of Saigon. I was lucky enough to have stayed at a hotel just across the street otherwise I probably would never have even found this place. I walked in for a quick bite as I was in a rush and the banh mi was so good we had to go back for more! In total, my friends and I were in Saigon for two days and ate there three times! I had both the pork and beef banh mi and they were delicious, but I was partial to the beef because the marinade was so good. And the price was very, very affordable. But best of all was the service. The shop owners were very nice and always greeted us with smiles. Just very friendly people in general. Next time I go to Saigon I will definitely stop in for some banh mi :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 9, 2016",
