            "review_title": "Review at Xiu Nho Baguette",
            "review_text": "OWSI\nLuzon, Philippines186 contributions\n0\nThe best banh mi this side of town\nMay 2016 • Solo\nA little banh mi shop along Thu Khoa Huan, District 1 Ho Chi Minh near Benh Than market. The shop has a good choices of banh mi, pork, chicken, beef, mushroom with lemon grass, egg and the most intriguing banh mi, the fish stomach or you can order mixed fillings for your banh mi, your style. They are all very delicious. For vegetarians, the mushroom with lemon grass is a winner. My favorite is the fish stomach, crunchy and very savory recipe. The baguette is fresh and well baked and the filling is very generous with tiny bits of fresh chili here and there for the added zest. Of course they have Vietnamese coffee as well and the low tables and stools. Much more the owner speaks English. What could make it more Vietnamese! Xin cao!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 24, 2016",
